      "message": "test(post): Haas, Mazak and Sinumerik probe goldens take #570's safe-plane descent\n\nThe same #579/#583 clash as #695 in the other dialects' bore-centre probe\ngoldens: probe_dialects failed 3/13 on main. The regenerated goldens rapid\nonly to the safe plane (Z50) and descend with a protected skip/MEAS move,\nwhere the stale ones rapided to Z25. Mazak's no-contact GOTO label moves\nfrom 9002 to 9003, one more guard ahead of it.\n\nRefs #695\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
